pod_engi.guide.settings.performance_profile.warning=The performance profile determines how certain functionality in the addon works. For example, the performance profile determines how long a pipe between two machines can be.
pod_engi.guide.settings.performance_profile.warning_xbox=%1%1§a§lSome consoles§r are known to crash under certain conditions with High or Extreme profiles selected.
