pod_engi.guide.workbench.title=Workbench
pod_engi.guide.workbench.body=Used for machines crafting.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%1§0X X X§r%1§0X§r 1 1%1§0X§r 2 2%1%11 = Iron Ingot%12 = Planks%1%1Crafts 1 Workbench.
pod_engi.guide.water_mill.title=Water Mill
pod_engi.guide.water_mill.body=A simple yet reliable way to generate power using the natural flow of water.%1Requires flowing water for the wheel to turn and generate power.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%12 3 2%11 2 1%1%11 = Planks%12 = Sturdy Frame%13 = Iron Gear%1%1Crafts 1 Water Mill.
pod_engi.guide.water_turbine.title=Water Turbine
pod_engi.guide.water_turbine.body=A more advanced and efficient power generator that thrives when submerged in deep water.%1Its output is based on the quantity of water surrounding it. Submerging it in deeper water will result in greater power generation.%1Be careful! Its metal components are prone to rust over time due to continuous water exposure. To prevent power generation loss, maintain it regularly using any type of axe.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%11 3 1%11 4 1%1%11 = Refined Metal Block%12 = Pump%13 = Iron Gear%14 = Logic Circuit%1%1Crafts 1 Water Turbine.
pod_engi.guide.windmill.title=Windmill
pod_engi.guide.windmill.body=This generator is converting wind energy into power.%1The Windmill is built from two parts: the Windmill Pillar and the Windmill Nacelle.%1%1§lWindmill Pillar§r%1This is the foundation of the Windmill. Pillars must be stacked vertically, one on top of another, to build a windmill tower. The height of the tower directly impacts how much wind the nacelle can capture and how much power it generates. Power transfer becomes ineffective beyond a height of 15 blocks, so be mindful when stacking pillars.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%11 2 1%1%11 = Refined Metal Block%12 = Copper Power Pipe%13 = Copper Wire%14 = Logic Circuit%1%1Crafts 2 Windmill Pillars.%1%1§lWindmill Nacelle§r%1Placed at the very top of the Windmill Pillar stack, the nacelle is the actual generator that converts wind energy into usable power.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 2%11 3 2%14 4 4%1%11 = Fabric%12 = Copper Wire%13 = Logic Circuit%14 = Refined Metal Block%1%1Crafts 1 Windmill Nacelle.
pod_engi.guide.diesel_generator.title=Diesel Generator
pod_engi.guide.diesel_generator.body=A powerful generator that generates large amounts of power by burning refined oil.%1The Diesel Generator is ideal for setups that demand consistent and high-output power, but it comes at the cost of fuel production and management.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%15 6 5%1%11 = Iron Gear%12 = Logic Circuit%13 = Refined Metal Block%14 = Ignition Powder%15 = Sturdy Frame%16 = Cauldron%1%1Crafts 1 Diesel Generator.
pod_engi.guide.oil_refinery.title=Oil Refinery
pod_engi.guide.oil_refinery.body=A machine that uses power to convert coal and bones into refined oil, which can be used in a Diesel Generator.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%11 3 1%14 4 4%1%11 = Glass Liquid Pipe%12 = Logic Circuit%13 = Iron Gear%14 = Refined Metal Block%1%1Crafts 1 Oil Refinery.
pod_engi.guide.void_machine.title=Void Machine
pod_engi.guide.void_machine.body=A machine that uses power to permanently destroy any item inserted into it.%1Has a small chance to grant experience upon item destruction.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%12 3 2%14 4 4%1%11 = Logic Circuit%12 = Popped Chorus Fruit%13 = Respawn Anchor%14 = Refined Metal Block%1%1Crafts 1 Void Machine.
pod_engi.guide.electric_furnace.title=Electric Furnace
pod_engi.guide.electric_furnace.body=A machine that uses power instead of fuel to cook or smelt items.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%15 6 5%1%11 = Glass%12 = Blast Furnace%13 = Copper Wire%14 = Ignition Powder%15 = Refined Metal Block%16 = Logic Circuit%1%1Crafts 1 Electric Furnace.
pod_engi.guide.pulverizer.title=Pulverizer
pod_engi.guide.pulverizer.body=A machine that uses power to pulverize ores, stone, and other items or blocks into their crushed or powdered forms.%1%1Stone -> 1x Cobblestone%1Cobblestone -> 1x Gravel%1Netherrack -> 1x Gravel%1Gravel -> 1x Flint%1Glass -> 1x Sand%1Sandstone -> 2x Sand%1Red Sandstone -> 2x Red Sand%1Bone -> 6x Bone Meal%1Blaze Rod -> 4x Blaze Powder%1Glowstone -> 4x Glowstone Dust%1Magma -> 4x Magma Cream%1Prismarine Shard -> 4x Prismarine Crystals%1Iron Ore -> 2x Pulverized Iron%1Deepslate Iron Ore -> 2x Pulverized Iron%1Gold Ore -> 2x Pulverized Gold%1Deepslate Gold Ore -> 2x Pulverized Gold%1Copper Ore -> 2x Pulverized Copper%1Deepslate Copper Ore -> 2x Pulverized Copper%1Coal Ore -> 2x Coal%1Deepslate Coal Ore -> 2x Coal%1Lapis Ore -> 6x Lapis Lazuli%1Deepslate Lapis Ore -> 6x Lapis Lazuli%1Redstone Ore -> 4x Redstone%1Deepslate Redstone Ore -> 4x Redstone%1Diamond Ore -> 2x Diamond%1Deepslate Diamond Ore -> 2x Diamond%1Emerald Ore -> 2x Emerald%1Deepslate Emerald Ore -> 2x Emerald%1Ancient Debris -> 2x Netherite Scrap%1Quartz Ore -> 3x Quartz%1Raw Iron -> 1x Pulverized Iron%1Raw Gold -> 1x Pulverized Gold%1Raw Copper -> 1x Pulverized Copper%1Sugar Cane -> 2x Sugar%1Breeze Rod -> 6x Wind Charge%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%12 2 2%1%11 = Copper Wire%12 = Refined Metal Block%13 = Iron Gear%14 = Logic Circuit%1%1Crafts 1 Pulverizer.
pod_engi.guide.dismantler.title=Dismantler
pod_engi.guide.dismantler.body=A machine that uses power to break down items into their original crafting components.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%15 5 5%1%11 = Glass%12 = Calibrated Circuit%13 = Iron Gear%14 = Heavy Core%15 = Refined Metal Block%1%1Crafts 1 Dismantler.
pod_engi.guide.infuser.title=Infuser
pod_engi.guide.infuser.body=A machine that uses essence, chicken egg, and a special item to transform the egg egg into a mob spawn egg.%1%1Feather -> Chicken Spawn Egg%1Honeycomb -> Bee Spawn Egg%1Beef -> Cow Spawn Egg%1Porkchop -> Pig Spawn Egg%1Mutton -> Sheep Spawn Egg%1Bone -> Wolf Spawn Egg%1Ice -> Polar Bear Spawn Egg%1Cat Spawn Egg -> Ocelot Spawn Egg%1String -> Cat Spawn Egg%1Red Mushroom -> Mooshroom Spawn Egg%1Coal -> Bat Spawn Egg%1Charcoal -> Bat Spawn Egg%1Cookie -> Parrot Spawn Egg%1Rabbit -> Rabbit Spawn Egg%1Carpet -> Llama Spawn Egg%1Chest -> Donkey Spawn Egg%1Saddle -> Horse Spawn Egg%1Donkey Spawn Egg -> Mule Spawn Egg%1Skeleton Spawn Egg -> Skeleton Horse Spawn Egg%1Zombie Spawn Egg -> Zombie Horse Spawn Egg%1Tropical Fish -> Tropical Fish Spawn Egg%1Cod -> Cod Spawn Egg%1Pufferfish -> Pufferfish Spawn Egg%1Salmon -> Salmon Spawn Egg%1Dried Kelp Block -> Dolphin Spawn Egg%1Seagrass -> Turtle Spawn Egg%1Bamboo -> Panda Spawn Egg%1Sweet Berries -> Fox Spawn Egg%1Gunpowder -> Creeper Spawn Egg%1Ender Pearl -> Enderman Spawn Egg%1Stone Bricks -> Silverfish Spawn Egg%1Nether Brick -> Wither Skeleton Spawn Egg%1Bow -> Skeleton Spawn Egg%1Arrow -> Skeleton Spawn Egg%1Slime Ball -> Slime Spawn Egg%1Spider Eye -> Spider Spawn Egg%1Rotten Flesh -> Zombie Spawn Egg%1Piglin Spawn Egg -> Zombie Pigman Spawn Egg%1Turtle Egg -> Husk Spawn Egg%1Nautilus Shell -> Drowned Spawn Egg%1Ink Sac -> Squid Spawn Egg%1Glow Ink Sac -> Glow Squid Spawn Egg%1Spider Spawn Egg -> Cave Spider Spawn Egg%1Splash Potion -> Witch Spawn Egg%1Prismarine Shard -> Guardian Spawn Egg%1Prismarine Crystals -> Elder Guardian Spawn Egg%1Chorus Fruit -> Endermite Spawn Egg%1Magma Cream -> Magma Cube Spawn Egg%1Warped Fungus -> Strider Spawn Egg%1Netherrack -> Hoglin Spawn Egg%1Gold Nugget -> Piglin Spawn Egg%1Hoglin Spawn Egg -> Zoglin Spawn Egg%1Golden Axe -> Piglin Brute Spawn Egg%1Goat Horn -> Goat Spawn Egg%1Glow Berries -> Axolotl Spawn Egg%1Echo Shard -> Warden Spawn Egg%1Diamond -> Allay Spawn Egg%1Froglight -> Frog Spawn Egg%1Frog Spawn -> Tadpole Spawn Egg%1Llama Spawn Egg -> Trader Llama Spawn Egg%1Cactus -> Camel Spawn Egg%1Ghast Tear -> Ghast Spawn Egg%1Blaze Rod -> Blaze Spawn Egg%1Shulker Shell -> Shulker Spawn Egg%1Iron Axe -> Vindicator Spawn Egg%1Witch Spawn Egg -> Evoker Spawn Egg%1Allay Spawn Egg -> Vex Spawn Egg%1Emerald -> Villager Spawn Egg%1Bundle -> Wandering Trader Spawn Egg%1Villager Spawn Egg -> Zombie Villager Spawn Egg%1Phantom Membrane -> Phantom Spawn Egg%1Crossbow -> Pillager Spawn Egg%1Pillager Spawn Egg -> Ravager Spawn Egg%1Iron Block -> Iron Golem Spawn Egg%1Carved Pumpkin -> Snow Golem Spawn Egg%1Torchflower -> Sniffer Spawn Egg%1Wind Charge -> Breeze Spawn Egg%1Armadillo Scute -> Armadillo Spawn Egg%1Mangrove Roots -> Bogged Spawn Egg%1Creaking Heart -> Creaking Spawn Egg%1Nether Star -> Wither Spawn Egg%1Dragon Head -> Dragon Spawn Egg%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%15 5 5%1%11 = Copper Power Pipe%12 = Calibrated Circuit%13 = Copper Wire%14 = Ignition Powder%15 = Refined Metal Block%1%1Crafts 1 Infuser.
pod_engi.guide.essence_tank.title=Essence Tank
pod_engi.guide.essence_tank.body=Stores essence.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%15 6 5%1%11 = Null Copper Block%12 = Glass%13 = Glass Liquid Pipe%14 = Cauldron%15 = Refined Metal Block%16 = Sturdy Frame%1%1Crafts 1 Essence Tank.
pod_engi.guide.battery.title=Power Battery
pod_engi.guide.battery.body=Stores power.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 1 1%12 3 2%14 4 4%1%11 = Block of Copper%12 = Calibrated Circuit%13 = Copper Power Pipe%14 = Refined Metal Block%1%1Crafts 1 Power Battery.
pod_engi.guide.power_wavelength_calibrator.title=Power Wavelength Calibrator
pod_engi.guide.power_wavelength_calibrator.body=Calibrates power wavelength with 6 different options. Interact to set the desired wavelength.%1Used to calibrate the Power channel of a Teleportation Pad.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%15 4 5%1%11 = Copper Wire%12 = Lever%13 = Calibrated Circuit%14 = Refined Metal Block%15 = Block of Copper%1%1Crafts 1 Power Wavelength Calibrator.
pod_engi.guide.essence_wavelength_calibrator.title=Essence Wavelength Calibrator
pod_engi.guide.essence_wavelength_calibrator.body=Calibrates the essence wavelength with 6 different options. Interact to set the desired wavelength.%1Used to calibrate the Essence channel of a Teleportation Pad.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 2 1%13 4 3%15 6 5%1%11 = Copper Wire%12 = Glass%13 = Calibrated Circuit%14 = Lever%15 = Refined Metal Block%16 = Null Copper Block%1%1Crafts 1 Essence Wavelength Calibrator.
pod_engi.guide.teleportation_pad.title=Teleportation Pad
pod_engi.guide.teleportation_pad.body=Teleports players to another Teleportation Pad with matching calibrations.%1%1Uses 3 calibration types:%1§l§6Power§r - set using the Power Wavelength Calibrator.%1§l§aEssence§r - set using the Essence Wavelength Calibrator.%1§lMain§r - set by interacting directly with the Teleportation Pad.%1%1Place the §6Power§r and §aEssence§r Wavelength Calibrators on the sides of the Teleportation Pad. Calibrate each component with the desired calibration.%1Standing on a Teleportation Pad will teleport you to another pad that has the same calibration.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%1§0X§r 1 §0X§r%12 3 2%14 4 4%1%11 = Ender Pearl%12 = Copper Wire%13 = Calibrated Circuit%14 = Refined Metal Block%1%1Crafts 1 Teleportation Pad.
pod_engi.guide.item_pipe_filter.title=Item Pipe Filter
pod_engi.guide.item_pipe_filter.body=A pipe that only allows a specific item to pass thorugh.%1Interact to insert the item you want to filter.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 1 1%12 3 2%11 1 1%1%11 = Iron Ingot%12 = Redstone Dust%13 = Lever%1%1Crafts 1 Item Pipe Filter.
pod_engi.guide.power_pipe_filter.title=Power Pipe Filter
pod_engi.guide.power_pipe_filter.body=A pipe that limits the flow of power.%1Interact to cycle through resistance levels: 2, 6 or 15 units per second.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 1 1%12 3 2%11 1 1%1%11 = Copper Ingot%12 = Redstone Dust%13 = Lever%1%1Crafts 1 Power Pipe Filter.
pod_engi.guide.liquid_pipe_filter.title=Liquid Pipe Filter
pod_engi.guide.liquid_pipe_filter.body=A pipe that limits the flow of liquid.%1Interact to cycle through resistance levels: 5, 10 or 25 mB per second.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%11 1 1%12 3 2%11 1 1%1%11 = Glass%12 = Redstone Dust%13 = Lever%1%1Crafts 1 Liquid Pipe Filter.
pod_engi.guide.oil_bucket.title=Oil Bucket
pod_engi.guide.oil_bucket.body=A bucket filled with processed Oil.%1Obtainable from the Oil Refinery. Oil can be used in Diesel Generator to produce energy.
pod_engi.guide.experience_bucket.title=Bucket o' Enchanting
pod_engi.guide.experience_bucket.body=A bucket filled with essence.%1Obtainable from the Mob Muncher. Essence can be used in the Essence Wavelength Calibrator, the Lightning Rod Calibrator, the Infuser, or stored inside an Essence Tank. Can also be drunk to gain some experience.
pod_engi.guide.truss_platform.title=Truss Platform
pod_engi.guide.truss_platform.body=A platform variant of the Truss can be crafted in a similar manner to slabs. It can be used as decoration.%1%1§lCrafting§r%1%1§0X X X§r%11 1 1%1§0X X X§r%1%11 = Truss%1%1Crafts 6 Truss Platform.
pod_engi.guide.pulverized_iron.title=Pulverized Iron
pod_engi.guide.pulverized_iron.body=Product of pulverizing Iron Ore. Can be smelted into Iron Ingot.
pod_engi.guide.pulverized_gold.title=Pulverized Gold
pod_engi.guide.pulverized_gold.body=Product of pulverizing Gold Ore. Can be smelted into Gold Ingot.
pod_engi.guide.pulverized_copper.title=Pulverized Copper
pod_engi.guide.pulverized_copper.body=Product of pulverizing Copper Ore. Can be smelted into Copper Ingot.
